bold text-gold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-primary">Local Businesses</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">For businesses that need stronger Google Maps visibility, local search relevance, calls, enquiries, and service-area leads.</div></div><div class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-white/[0.06]"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold/10 text-gold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-black"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shopping-bag"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V6l-3-4z"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 01-8 0"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-primary">eCommerce Brands</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">For Shopify stores and online brands that need better product discovery, category visibility, and sustainable organic sales.</div></div><div class="group flex items-center gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/40 hover:bg-white/[0.06]"><div class="flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold/10 text-gold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-gold group-hover:text-black"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-building2"><path d="M6 22V4a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v18z"/><path d="M6 12H4a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2"/><path d="M18 9h2a2 2 0 012 2v9a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2"/><path d="M10 6h4"/><path d="M10 10h4"/><path d="M10 14h4"/><path d="M10 18h4"/></svg></div><div><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gold transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-primary">Growing Companies</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">For service businesses, consultants, agencies, and brands that need stronger pages, websites, and organic lead generation.</div></div></div><div class=lg:col-span-5><div class="group relative mx-auto h-full w-full max-w-[500px]"><div aria-hidden=true class="absolute -inset-1 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/30 to-purple-500/30 opacity-30 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-60"></div><div class="relative flex h-full items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-black/40 p-3 backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-500 group-hover:border-primary/50"><video loop playsinline preload=none aria-hidden=true class="h-auto max-h-[420px] w-full rounded-xl object-contain transition-opacity duration-700 opacity-0">Your browser does not support the video tag.</video></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative z-20 pb-10 pt-16"><div class=section-container><div class="mb-12 text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Why Businesses Struggle to <span class="mx-2 text-4xl italic text-destructive sm:text-5xl">Rank</span><span class=text-white>on Google</span></h2></div><div class="mb-16 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-destructive/40"><div class="absolute -inset-1 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-destructive/20 to-transparent opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-destructive/20 bg-destructive/10 shadow-lg"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-7 w-7 text-destructive transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-destructive/90">Weak Search Intent</h3><p class="text-m leading-relaxed text-white/70">Important service and product pages do not clearly answer what real customers are searching for.</div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-destructive/40"><div class="absolute -inset-1 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-destructive/20 to-transparent opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-destructive/20 bg-destructive/10 shadow-lg"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone h-7 w-7 text-destructive transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"/><path d="M12 18h.01"/></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-destructive/90">Poor Mobile Experience</h3><p class="text-m leading-relaxed text-white/70">Slow, unclear, or difficult mobile pages can hurt engagement, leads, and sales.</div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-destructive/40"><div class="absolute -inset-1 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-destructive/20 to-transparent opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-destructive/20 bg-destructive/10 shadow-lg"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench h-7 w-7 text-destructive transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 000 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 001.4.0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 01-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12.0 01-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 017.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-destructive/90">Technical SEO Gaps</h3><p class="text-m leading-relaxed text-white/70">Indexation issues, weak internal links, duplicate content, and slow templates limit visibility.</div><div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 text-center transition-all duration-300 hover:border-destructive/40"><div class="absolute -inset-1 -z-10 bg-gradient-to-b from-destructive/20 to-transparent opacity-0 blur-xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="mx-auto mb-6 flex h-14 w-14 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-destructive/20 bg-destructive/10 shadow-lg"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-down h-7 w-7 text-destructive transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110"><polyline points="22 17 13.5 8.5 8.5 13.5 2 7"/><polyline points="16 17 22 17 22 11"/></svg></div><h3 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold text-white transition-colors group-hover:text-destructive/90">No Growth Roadmap</h3><p class="text-m leading-relaxed text-white/70">Random SEO tasks and disconnected content do not create a reliable path to long-term growth.</div></div><div class=text-center><button type=button aria-label="Explore RankVelt SEO services" class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 border-none bg-transparent text-lg font-semibold text-primary transition-all hover:gap-4 hover:text-primary/80">See How RankVelt Fixes This<svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></button></div></div></section><section id=services class="relative z-20 scroll-mt-28 pb-16 pt-6"><div class=section-container><div class="mb-10 text-center"><h2 class="mb-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">SEO Services for Growth & Revenue</h2><p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">SEO First. Web Design When It Supports Growth.</div><div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="group relative flex cursor-default items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.03] p-3 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-primary/50 hover:bg-white/[0.05]"><div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/10 to-transparent opacity-0 blur-md transition-opacity duration-300 group-hover:opacity-100"></div><div class="z-10 shrink-0"><div class="rounded-md bg-primary/10 p-1.5 text-primary shadow-sm shadow-primary/20 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4"><path d="M21.801 10A10 10 0 1117 3.335"/><path d="m9 11 3 3L22 4"/></svg></div></div><div class="z-10 flex w-full flex-col"><h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-white transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:text-primary">Local SEO</h3><p class="text-[15px] leading-tight text-white/65 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">Improve Google Maps visibility, local rankings, and service-area leads that convert into real customers.</p><a href=/local-seo class="z-20 mt-1.5 inline-flex w-fit cu