le results.</span></h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5"><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)><div class="absolute -right-4 -top-7 text-8xl font-black text-white/[0.025] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110">01</div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-primary">Step 1</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-black text-white">Discovery</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">We review your business goals, website, competitors, target market, and the search opportunities that matter most.</div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)><div class="absolute -right-4 -top-7 text-8xl font-black text-white/[0.025] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110">02</div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-primary">Step 2</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-black text-white">SEO Roadmap</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">You receive a practical growth plan covering priority pages, technical gaps, content needs, and realistic next steps.</div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)><div class="absolute -right-4 -top-7 text-8xl font-black text-white/[0.025] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110">03</div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-primary">Step 3</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-black text-white">Implementation</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">RankVelt improves the highest-impact pages, website structure, technical foundations, and conversion pathways.</div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)><div class="absolute -right-4 -top-7 text-8xl font-black text-white/[0.025] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110">04</div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-primary">Step 4</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-black text-white">Measurement</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">We monitor relevant progress, identify new opportunities, and refine the plan around real data and business goals.</div></div><div class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-8 transition-all duration-500 hover:bg-white/[0.05]" style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)><div class="absolute -right-4 -top-7 text-8xl font-black text-white/[0.025] transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-110">05</div><div class="relative z-10"><span class="text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-primary">Step 5</span><h3 class="mt-5 text-2xl font-black text-white">Sustainable Growth</h3><p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">SEO becomes a repeatable growth system supported by clearer content, stronger pages, and ongoing improvements.</div></div></div></div></section></div><div id=audit class="relative z-20 scroll-mt-28"><section class="px-6 py-12"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl"><div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border border-white/5 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.03] to-transparent p-8 shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md md:p-10" style=opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)><div class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-96 w-96 translate-x-1/2 -trans