RankVelt focuses on local businesses, eCommerce brands, service businesses, consultants, agencies, and growing companies that want better organic visibility and stronger website foundations.</div></div></details><details class="group glass-card overflow-hidden border border-white/5 transition-all duration-300 [&[open]]:border-primary/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between p-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-primary transition-colors group-open:bg-primary group-open:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up h-4 w-4"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"/><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"/></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">How long does SEO take to show progress?</span></div><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 group-open:text-primary"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 font-light leading-relaxed text-white/60"><div class="border-t border-white/5 pt-4">SEO timelines depend on your market, competitors, website history, technical condition, and the amount of work required. The first goal is to identify the highest-impact work and create a clear roadmap instead of making random changes.</div></div></details><details class="group glass-card overflow-hidden border border-white/5 transition-all duration-300 [&[open]]:border-primary/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between p-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-primary transition-colors group-open:bg-primary group-open:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pinned h-4 w-4"><path d="M18 8c0 3.613-3.869 7.429-5.393 8.795a1 1 0 01-1.214.0C9.87 15.429 6 11.613 6 8a6 6 0 0112 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="2"/><path d="M8.714 14h-3.71a1 1 0 00-.948.683l-2.004 6A1 1 0 003 22h18a1 1 0 00.948-1.316l-2-6A1 1 0 0018.999 14h-3.712"/></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Do you offer Local SEO services?</span></div><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 group-open:text-primary"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 font-light leading-relaxed text-white/60"><div class="border-t border-white/5 pt-4">Yes. Local SEO support can include Google Business Profile optimization, local keyword research, service-area pages, local visibility improvements, review strategy guidance, and location-based content planning.</div></div></details><details class="group glass-card overflow-hidden border border-white/5 transition-all duration-300 [&[open]]:border-primary/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between p-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-primary transition-colors group-open:bg-primary group-open:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shopping-bag h-4 w-4"><path d="M6 2 3 6v14a2 2 0 002 2h14a2 2 0 002-2V6l-3-4z"/><path d="M3 6h18"/><path d="M16 10a4 4 0 01-8 0"/></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Can you help with Shopify and eCommerce SEO?</span></div><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 group-open:text-primary"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 font-light leading-relaxed text-white/60"><div class="border-t border-white/5 pt-4">Yes. RankVelt supports collection pages, product pages, internal linking, Shopify technical foundations, category visibility, search-focused content, and better product discovery paths.</div></div></details><details class="group glass-card overflow-hidden border border-white/5 transition-all duration-300 [&[open]]:border-primary/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between p-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-primary transition-colors group-open:bg-primary group-open:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-panels-top-left h-4 w-4"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"/><path d="M3 9h18"/><path d="M9 21V9"/></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Do you also build WordPress websites and Shopify stores?</span></div><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 group-open:text-primary"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 font-light leading-relaxed text-white/60"><div class="border-t border-white/5 pt-4">Yes. Website design is available when it supports SEO and growth. This can include SEO-ready WordPress websites, Shopify store structure, landing pages, mobile improvements, and conversion-focused redesigns.</div></div></details><details class="group glass-card overflow-hidden border border-white/5 transition-all duration-300 [&[open]]:border-primary/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between p-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-primary transition-colors group-open:bg-primary group-open:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 01-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 011-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17.0 011.52.0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 011 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Can you guarantee first-page or number-one rankings?</span></div><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 group-open:text-primary"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 font-light leading-relaxed text-white/60"><div class="border-t border-white/5 pt-4">No. Ethical SEO cannot guarantee a specific ranking position. RankVelt focuses on improving search relevance, technical health, useful page content, user experience, and the long-term signals that support stronger visibility.</div></div></details><details class="group glass-card overflow-hidden border border-white/5 transition-all duration-300 [&[open]]:border-primary/30"><summary class="flex cursor-pointer select-none items-center justify-between p-6 list-none [&::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div class="flex items-center gap-4"><div class="flex size-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white/5 text-primary transition-colors group-open:bg-primary group-open:text-black"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/></svg></div><span class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">Will I work directly with the person handling my SEO?</span></div><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-white/40 transition-transform duration-300 group-open:rotate-180 group-open:text-primary"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="px-6 pb-6 font-light leading-relaxed text-white/60"><div class="border-t border-white/5 pt-4">Yes. RankVelt is founder-led. You work directly with the strategist responsible for your SEO direction, website priorities, communication, and next-step recommendations.</div></div></details></div></div></div></section></div><section id=final-cta class="radial-glow relative z-20 py-24"><div class="section-container relative z-10 text-center"><h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Ready to Build Stronger <span class=text-gradient-gold>Google Visibility & Growth?</span></h2><p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/60">Start with a focused conversation about your website, your current visibility, and the highest-priority opportunities for growth.<div><button type=button class="gradient-cta inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-xl px-10 py-5 text-lg shadow-2xl shadow-primary/20 transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105 cursor-pointer" aria-label="Request an SEO growth strategy call"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-rocket h-5 w-5"><path d="M4.5 16.5c-1.5 1.26-2 5-2 5s3.74-.5 5-2c.71-.84.7-2.13-.09-2.91A2.18 2.18.0 004.5 16.5z"/><path d="m12 15-3-3a22 22 0 012-3.95A12.88 12.88.0 0122 2c0 2.72-.78 7.5-6 11a22.35 22.35.0 01-4 2z"/><path d="M9 12H4s.55-3.03 2-4c1.62-1.08 5 0 5 0"/><path d="M12 15v5s3.03-.55 4-2c1.08-1.62.0-5 0-5"/></svg>Get a Free SEO Audit</button></div><p class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-muted-foreground"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield mr-2 h-4 w-4 text-primary"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 01-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 011-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17.0 011.52.0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 011 1z"/></svg>Clear priorities, direct communication, and no unnecessary agency layers.</div></section><div class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 border-t border-white/10 bg-background p-4 pb-safe sm:hidden"><button type=button class="gradient-cta flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg py-3.5 font-semibold shadow-lg shadow-primary/20 cursor-pointer" aria-label="Request a strategy call"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-target h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="2"/></svg>Get a Free SEO Audit</button></div><style>.shimmer-text-effect{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#666 0%,#fff 50%,#666 100%);background-size:200%;-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent}@media(min-width:768px){.shimmer-text-effect{animation:shine 3s linear infinite}}@keyframes shine{to{background-position:200%}}.pb-safe{padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,16px)}</style></div><footer class="w-full overflow-hidden border-t border-white/[0.06] bg-[#050505]"><div class="w-full px-6 py-14 sm:px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 xl:px-20 2xl:px-24"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_2fr] lg:gap-16"><div><button type=button class="flex items-center gap-3 text-left" aria-label="Go to RankVelt homepage"><img src=/rankvelt-icon-64.webp alt="RankVelt SEO and Web Growth Studio" width=42 height=42 loading=eager decoding=async><span><span class="block text-xl font-black tracking-tight text-white">Rank<span class=text>Velt</span></span><span class="mt-1 block text-[9px] font-black uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-white/70">SEO & Web Growth Studio</span></span></button><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-sm leading-7 text-white/70">RankVelt helps local businesses, eCommerce brands and growing companies improve search visibility, website structure, product discovery and conversion-focused customer journeys.<div class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-sm text-white/70"><a href=mailto:info@rankvelt.com class="flex w-fit items-center gap-3 transition-colors hover:text-[#f9a825]"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-mail"><rect width="20" height="16" x="2" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94.0 01-2.06.0L2 7"/></svg>info@rankvelt.com</a><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 01-1.202.0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a